def detect_wall_rotation(
    xyz:np.ndarray, floor_z:float, ceiling_z:float, cell:float=0.02
)-&gt;float:
Estimate the rotation (deg, about Z) that aligns the dominant walls with X/Y.
Takes a horizontal band of the cloud, rasterises it to a density image, computes image gradients and finds the dominant gradient orientation modulo 90 degrees. Returns the angle to rotate the cloud by (counter- clockwise positive).




